ill try to place the next gem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7. Repeat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the CPU's turn ends, the player's turn begins again, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and the cycle continues to repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8. win and lose conditions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100100/extras/3117d087619f66d258c1528e6a11d5bb.poster.avif?t=1730877313\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100100/extras/3117d087619f66d258c1528e6a11d5bb.webm?t=1730877313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100100/extras/3117d087619f66d258c1528e6a11d5bb.mp4?t=1730877313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player wins when all gems in the player's hand are eliminated,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100100/extras/c538459b33b13412554f57b48f729887.poster.avif?t=1730877313\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100100/extras/c538459b33b13412554f57b48f729887.webm?t=1730877313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100100/extras/c538459b33b13412554f57b48f729887.mp4?t=1730877313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If any of the CPU's get rid of all their gems, they lose. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9. In this game...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100100/extras/70878f432b2d6c2c820dc02a9fc1a2d0.avif?t=1730877313\" width=178 height=164 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are gems that have special effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100100/extras/a82b4e551a5b6fcc46f0da84c117c542.avif?t=1730877313\" width=340 height=164 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >special gems themselves.</p>",
